      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZARA'S SECRET (8) was safely held in tougher company last start at Mandurah, but prior to that won by 3 lengths at Mandurah (17.32) beating Red Ned Gundi in a Grade 4/5 on July 30. Strong form has emerged from her last run. Has ability and can bounce back. WILLOW'S WITCH (1) three runs back clocked an excellent 17.97 win over 312m at this track then has found the minor money in two runs since. Expected to feature on best figures. MISH MASH (2) had been in super honest form hitting the frame two times on end before finishing fourth (18.49) at this track last time. Form here sound including eight wins. Can figure in the finish. SYDNEY SURCHARGE (4) can measure up with the right run.",
